flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Begin optimization"]
MOO_Controller["**MOO_Controller**<br/>Population based multi objective optimizer<br/>Objectives throughput max and wip min"]
BufferDomain["**Buffer_Capacity_Domain**<br/>All DelayBuffer capacity variables<br/>Discrete values {1-4}"]
Population["**Population**<br/>Collection of Individuals<br/>Configurable size"]
Individual["**Individual**<br/>Attributes vector of buffer capacities<br/>Methods mutate crossover evaluate"]
Selection["**Selection**<br/>Choose parents for reproduction<br/>Tournament or ranking"]
Crossover["**Crossover**<br/>Combine parent capacity vectors<br/>Discrete operators"]
Mutation["**Mutation**<br/>Random gene perturbation<br/>Clamp to {1-4}"]
StochasticEval["**Stochastic_Evaluator**<br/>Run multiple seeds per individual<br/>Aggregate throughput and wip statistics"]
SimulatorRun["**Simulator_Run**<br/>Invoke run_simulation with candidate capacities<br/>Return overall metrics throughput and wip"]
SimulationModel["**Simulation_Model**<br/>Encapsulates run_simulation setup and execution<br/>Exposes API to set DelayBuffer capacities"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes cap delay tokens store<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>Attributes process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power<br/>Methods run _breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
ParetoArchive["**Pareto_Archive**<br/>Store non dominated solutions<br/>Update after each evaluation"]
Replacement["**Population_Replacement**<br/>Form next generation from parents offspring and archive"]
Termination["**Termination_Criteria**<br/>Max generations or time budget or no improvement"]
Output["**Optimized_Configurations**<br/>Pareto front of buffer capacity vectors<br/>Tradeoffs throughput and wip"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete and export results"]

Start --> MOO_Controller
MOO_Controller --> BufferDomain
MOO_Controller --> Population
Population --> Individual
Individual --> Selection
Selection --> Crossover
Crossover --> Mutation
Mutation --> StochasticEval
StochasticEval --> SimulatorRun
SimulatorRun --> SimulationModel
SimulationModel --> DelayBufferClass
SimulationModel --> MachineClass
SimulatorRun --> StochasticEval
StochasticEval --> ParetoArchive
ParetoArchive --> Replacement
Replacement --> Population
ParetoArchive --> Termination
Termination -->|not finished| Selection
Termination -->|finished| Output
Output --> End